{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "dc3b6165682c226388905953f2f9374f7fd7284bfa42a59c92298803dd8f1603", "ja": "暗黒の手品師『ジョーカー卿』襲来！", "zh": "暗黑魔术师“Joker卿”来袭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d569fac70f11b7628a225bbabf907c1365a1f67bc9580c08cdb6f2931c8ea4f5", "ja": "デストルドー幹部・ジョーカー卿は、その技\nで街をまるごと人質に取り、ヒーローズを\nピンチに陥れる。見かねた高木博士は状況打\n開のため、自らの生命力と引き換えに秘密兵\n器を作動させてヒーローズを救うのだった！", "zh": "德斯特鲁多干部·小丑卿用那项技\n能将整座城市扣为人质，使英雄们\n陷入危机。看不下去的高木博士为了\n打破僵局，以自己的生命力为代价启动秘密兵\n器，救出了英雄们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "78c612991d1cc4a6ac0d981a73d94c4a831df95738e5c141a9fe447606ad77ea", "ja": "二人目のマイティセーラー・莉緒の誕生を切っ掛けに、\n希望の光は勢いよく広がっていった。", "zh": "以第二位Mighty Sailor莉绪的诞生为契机，希望之光迅速扩散开来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "5acbae4c8816e79ae59f242514a494ad37284b94ef41d2374eee939a876a99be", "ja": "ヒーロー達は体制を整え、各地でデストルドーに\n拮抗したものの、デストルドーもまた強大だった。", "zh": "英雄们整顿好阵势，虽然在各地与迪斯特尔多势均力敌，但迪斯特尔多也同样强大。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "7160d4e5738195b20f5a562e90691bce8282241edbc22b38442249c1d5ae86c6", "ja": "その後に現れた三人目のマイティセーラーを、\n激闘の果てに失うほどに……。", "zh": "甚至在那场激战中失去了后来出现的第三位Mighty Sailor……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "2d274653b96839db05b139feb586ca48c18f5cff9870a9a471bb6ed87f8a3c90", "ja": "そして今、また新たな脅威が\nヒーロー達の前に現れたのだった！", "zh": "而现在，又有新的威胁\n出现在英雄们面前！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "3e8434afcf99f067010565cac0ecdfb841ed52bb78cdf3f0260246240995bfb4", "ja": "愛も正義も虚しいもの。かなわない夢を求めて、\n誰も彼もが必死に無様な努力をしてばかり。", "zh": "爱与正义皆为空虚。追寻着无法实现的梦想，\n每个人都只在一味拼命做着难看的努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "baf6be279923ebf9419e2f36e534853b01a75a09c7d05f8f52bdc8ff3fb2186e", "ja": "ですから、求める気持ちを無くしてあげましょう。\n……3、2、1、どうぞ。", "zh": "所以，就让我帮你消除追求的心情吧。\n……3、2、1，请收下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1006_se", "source_sha256": "486de56ceb70b2b8d85c8da2217c12b4c64b21fa2c6a9c94cca3738e38310488", "ja": "ブゥン！！", "zh": "轰——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1007_siminnominasan", "source_sha256": "982ee5dcc9be8cfc7f001b9162b4f5085dd87cf0a7ff17468d6e74bf3e7ce298", "ja": "あああ……ああぁ……。ぁぁ……。", "zh": "啊啊啊……啊啊啊……呜呜……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "0908b3e63883b664bc2f820cfb4ecab4ab61736d1e791d444273e1a67ebbdb0a", "ja": "人々の正義の心を吸い取り、服従させる力を持つ、\nデストルドー貴族……。", "zh": "吸取人们心中的正义，并拥有让人们臣服的力量——\n这就是德斯特鲁多贵族……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "cf7e47d05d91ba62b648bec9ab8c67fd4c08f090c6e93d778d31e9f01ed0b68f", "ja": "暗黒の手品師『ジョーカー卿』が、\nヒーローズの抹殺を図ったのである！", "zh": "黑暗魔术师『小丑爵士』，\n企图将英雄们斩草除根！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "3c26f3b575e647cef0bc0c0c9ad0096becb73388e1bf1872732406caf5bf50e1", "ja": "あのジョーカー卿が二か所同時に出現！？\nそんな……あいつ、分身までできるっていうの？", "zh": "那个小丑卿在两处同时出现了！？\n怎么会……难道说那家伙，连分身都会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "4123a2ee3b9fe6b45526aa348ff1797641a9f8a0dd3dbc46f61869a0caaa0759", "ja": "莉緒ちゃん、大丈夫よ。私たちも二人いるんだもの。\nここは二手に分かれましょう。", "zh": "莉緒，没事的。我们这边也有两个人呀。\n就这样分头行动吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "618a7ae156337b488cea058593008d2ecb39c649e2babc2c60947df3f805362c", "ja": "危険よ！　戦力を分散するなんて……。\n罠の可能性だってあるかもしれないじゃない。", "zh": "太危险了！竟然还要分散战力……  \n说不定这可能是个陷阱啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "07759f72414828e209a9425669e46c871819c98246f81590c2548de492de2e0f", "ja": "それでも、行かなくっちゃ！\nだって……私たちはヒーローだもの。", "zh": "即便如此，也必须去！\n因为……我们可是英雄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "fd04954ff557a8463fc419b9837ce85f5a20440d33b84174e1d63afadc4e7783", "ja": "あずさちゃん……。もう、相変わらずなんだから。", "zh": "梓……真是的，还是老样子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "07be1e2b1f65b4bd3954cb67b82ad5528ac5ca88981278f47275f5d6a1be8260", "ja": "あずさと分かれ、関西のとある都市へと向かった莉緒。\nしかし、そこで彼女を待ち受けていたのは……！", "zh": "与梓分别后，莉绪前往关西的某座城市。\n然而，在那里等待着她的却是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "5957c2e6ff868a7b65ac04ac2fad62a6ca84ec10c0905766377657683055e7d2", "ja": "ようこそ、マイティセーラー。我はリトルジョーカー。\nジョーカー卿のマスコットで本体的な分身的存在だ！", "zh": "欢迎你，Mighty Sailor。我是Little Joker。是Joker卿的吉祥物，也是类似本体的分身存在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "886602879f2b83b02ad54e27e19e8b1bc2faf67b84e1ec47453cf001778eba9e", "ja": "意味が分からないわ！　でもやっぱり罠だったのね。\n急いであずさちゃんの所に戻らないと……！", "zh": "我完全听不懂！不过果然是陷阱啊。\n得赶紧回到梓那里才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "864a69f220eba6a14727be0df3bdc963e61cccb05f6c7900b80445370b841321", "ja": "ククク、させるものか。貴様はここで屍をさらすのだ。\nくらえっ！　リトルジョーカー・マジックショウ！", "zh": "呵呵呵，休想得逞。你就把尸体留在这里吧。\n接招！小丑魔术秀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "f3720884d53a1c6266f6883e39ba66ffdf6d509d75b59f7c2922be1ead39a9b8", "ja": "うるさいわねっ、大人しくしてなさい！\nキネティック・セクシースプラーッシュ！", "zh": "吵死啦，给我老实点！\n动能性感水花飞溅——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1020_se", "source_sha256": "7c54b894e4322b58a1439c69c31a3cea09cd71f6dedf3ff4a82335e201eb8b91", "ja": "シュワワワワ……！！", "zh": "哗哗哗哗……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "6140a90069735f84c57cec942f581ec9bdc791bc3e0e4ff78e587b310f4d7704", "ja": "ぐああああっ！　バカな、このリトルジョーカーが、\n世界を愛おしく感じてしまう！　こ、これは一体……？", "zh": "呜啊啊啊啊！怎么可能，这个小丑牌竟然会觉得世界如此可爱！这、这到底是怎么回事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1022_046rio", "source_sha256": "e63828a4d06ba061d1659b4025c86f4ee793caed6f5ec6229c1e790fb60b5295", "ja": "覚えておくことね……。\nこれが、愛の力よ！", "zh": "记住了吗……\n这，就是爱的力量！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "5912a2a7e2466a44599f693ba938f7ef867be0f9342e1d4edf2c0bbab93f82f4", "ja": "一方その頃、マイティセーラーあずさは、\nジョーカー卿と対峙していた！", "zh": "与此同时，强力水手阿梓正与小丑爵士对峙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "8752d0eb0c1ad0cd27845aeb1f597199c029be0d4a1b8785abad2b4115f947ed", "ja": "お待ちしていました、ヒーロー。\nおもてなしの準備は万端、整っています。", "zh": "等候您多时了，英雄。\n款待您的准备已经全部就绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1025_010azu", "source_sha256": "5f4cc6ac9c8374ab2433c43753926f50b240b8d36dcdab184439babbb8590dc7", "ja": "ジョーカー卿。今日こそは貴方を倒してみせます！", "zh": "小丑爵士。今天我一定要打倒您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1026_044miz", "source_sha256": "eab34d12a5aef39fc5c9fb268bdefbd8c8a76ef1e584a2d412c353b090cacfdb", "ja": "おっと、動かないことです。貴女が動けば、私がこの\n街に張り巡らせた『虚無空間』が起動しますよ。", "zh": "等等，请不要动。您一动，我布置在这座城市各处的『虚无空间』就会启动哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "19f69f76dff119e8061aac91285f0a2eb181b24e0d8eae24705d853b5d599847", "ja": "起動テストも良好でした。次に起動すれば、\nこの街の人間はすべてデストル化することでしょう。", "zh": "启动测试也很顺利。下次启动后，\n这座城市里的人全都会变成德斯特尔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1028_010azu", "source_sha256": "75897bffb9d7f3499ccc10bc8fec1f9e2c831b24c88c1b8555efd95aacc195d9", "ja": "なんですって！？　街のすべての人が……？\nくっ、なんて卑怯なの！？", "zh": "什么！？城里所有人都……？\n可恶，太卑鄙了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "5bba42f3f9e66809bfb58bd0e76f4e4430f36535bc585649705b2c2580b22dcf", "ja": "合理的と言ってください。おかげで私は、こうして\n一方的に、貴女を……攻撃できるのですから。", "zh": "请说是合理。多亏了这样，我才能像现在这样\n单方面地，对你……发起攻击。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1030_010azu", "source_sha256": "8fa7ee3a1b74b872b66e689aa95e5a2662ab7db4df822e7aec59ecad591b56e8", "ja": "うっ！　あっ！　ああっ！！", "zh": "呜！　啊！　啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1031_044miz", "source_sha256": "0fd4251a074b8752160826859ac5ad27ce743af70fb2ff6cafd0eee9d82266ea", "ja": "心や感情というものは、本当に邪魔で無駄なものです。\n正義の力とやらも、振るえなければ……無力と同じ。", "zh": "心灵和感情这种东西，真是碍事又多余。\n所谓正义的力量，如果无法挥动……和无力也没什么两样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1032_010azu", "source_sha256": "5e67d117213f00813c1fe75118010377e88d7c65ff388ba2b8afa501a8136b85", "ja": "ううっ！　ああっ！　ああぁ……。", "zh": "呜呜！啊啊！啊啊啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1033_044miz", "source_sha256": "765ddebd231d089962f281daa166c5b7ea25061787d385a98cc200e045067f93", "ja": "では、そろそろ終わりにしましょう。ご安心ください。\nほどなく世界中が、貴女と運命を共にします。", "zh": "那么，也差不多该结束了。请放心。\n很快，全世界都会与您一同迎来命运。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1034_044miz", "source_sha256": "72b8ab8eac45d7964274b52a26914c00cbc6ea8dd6c25c1e8ac89ba2470c751a", "ja": "どうぞ、永劫の闇の彼方へ。\n……いってらっしゃい。", "zh": "请前往永恒黑暗的彼方。\n……一路走好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1035_president", "source_sha256": "8358e891dfa20db0ee6402f5ed73425f942713b35ce4cfd916e11f85325046e9", "ja": "解析は終了した！　させるものかァ！！", "zh": "解析完成了！休想让我停下来！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1036_026yur", "source_sha256": "5b99bcb451883bda456c6b93815858e4a1c004e666f943f117a80d623fa736e5", "ja": "その時！　高木は虚無空間を充填消滅させる秘密兵器\n『キネティック・インフィニティ』を作動させた！", "zh": "就在那时！高木启动了能将虚无空间填充并消灭的秘密兵器——\n『动能无限』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1037_se", "source_sha256": "34a7b7ffc9a8166839507238da0e49d73141ce8bc5b93e03bf84b3eae664a0e8", "ja": "ブイン！！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1038_044miz", "source_sha256": "ae9608a5f54b0775ed7c3c3a1d10f1a913cf86084bd26122705dd1578f782e22", "ja": "これは？　私の虚無空間に生命エネルギーを強制充填\nして、消滅させたようですね……。驚きました。", "zh": "这是……？把生命能量强行充入我的虚无空间，\n让它消失了……真令人惊讶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1039_044miz", "source_sha256": "bae2436cadc3add3ef5067b29ace2b8a8f862254759f8cd38944768d0e16123f", "ja": "でも、そのエネルギーの元は、どこから……？", "zh": "不过，那股能量的来源究竟是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1040_010azu", "source_sha256": "9df98e0dbb4d9dd7ac6b790f136f8e6041f04b84a68cd95dc16fd920b6c1cbfa", "ja": "はっ！　まさか……博士？　高木さん！？\n貴方なの！？", "zh": "啊！难道是……博士？高木先生！？  \n是您吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1041_026yur", "source_sha256": "c536d858f9a131210b720526569ab46b91d6b57026e246bea49e1d1f3fd5e857", "ja": "『キネティック・インフィニティ』により、高木は自ら\nの生命力を無限拡張し、虚無空間に注ぎ込んだのだ！", "zh": "通过《动能·无限》，高木将自己的生命力无限扩张，\n并注入了虚无空间！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1042_026yur", "source_sha256": "382203db0f6d0ee337c084025e5d4ad6ce9b666b5d93d945f4533bee6941a40b", "ja": "だが、すべての生命力を使い果たした高木の身体は、\n文字通りの抜け殻となった……。", "zh": "但是，用尽了全部生命力的高木，身体真的变成了一具空壳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1043_president", "source_sha256": "0306ed48c9f812653a2bb2d1231363795fe22bb510655d109f66eedd9fcb7cf1", "ja": "（後は頼んだよ、あずさ君、莉緒君。\nそしてそのあとに続く、アイドルヒーローズ達……）", "zh": "（接下来就拜托你们了，梓、莉绪。还有紧随其后的偶像英雄们……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1044_010azu", "source_sha256": "034c1cafb3abda85f316806f22b1f5a69b57d868b35aff7e48eee115d1d09eab", "ja": "いやああああっ！", "zh": "呀啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1045_044miz", "source_sha256": "646b4ceb1d2b0bc53a2f956f308b7b03845f1471358d5e052dabee1bd63a28cd", "ja": "とはいえ、私の前には弱ったヒーローが一人いるだけ。\n状況に変化は……おや。もう一人が接近していますね。", "zh": "话虽如此，在我面前的也只有一名虚弱的英雄。\n情况没有变化……哎呀，又有一人接近了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1046_044miz", "source_sha256": "9ae6d57b25585f409bbb7588fcedf4233b740ae3e8e792f6de0804deca9b6a66", "ja": "リトルが敗れましたか……。今日の手札は使いきって\nしまいました。ここは一旦引き揚げましょう。", "zh": "小个子败了吗……今天的底牌已经用尽了。这里还是先撤退吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1047_026yur", "source_sha256": "f2dadd04e9eb5e69403450a230e0973d7e12714a121610417a7f32fd7e7f23c2", "ja": "こうしてヒーロー達は大きな危機を回避した。\nだが失ったものもまた、あまりにも大きかった……。", "zh": "就这样，英雄们避开了巨大的危机。\n然而，他们失去的东西也同样太多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0410_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_04_1048_026yur", "source_sha256": "12d280644b9dc04ad8cfca1bda0f902958966d37c774387037c432a09eead928", "ja": "次回『新たな希望！　託された未来！！』\n……待っててください。今行きます！", "zh": "下集《新的希望！托付的未来！！》\n……请等着我。我这就来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
